From 906677f8f353d2c20a33a90f92bdbf517de6e7fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 18:58:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Inline AnyCol, AnyColumnReference, AnyColumnGroupAccessor,
 StringCol and ColumnGroupReference type aliases in public API

Follow-up to #1863. Replaces the aliases with their expanded types in public
declarations of `core` and `dataframe-arrow` so code completion shows the real
types. Internal usages and the alias declarations themselves are left intact.

Closes #1866
